#>wonder_agents_plans_curriculumhtmlsvgmastery_wi_2
?["Which SVG geometry claims can a no-browser check assert at all?"]{
  #:depth #!computational // lens: capability probe
  ~#hypothesis: "viewBox and attribute facts check in jsdom, but path length, bounding box and transform results need a pure-TypeScript evaluator"
  ~#observed: "one scratch run on 2026-10-12 with the repo jsdom: svg viewBox.baseVal.width read 10 for viewBox 0 0 10 10, while typeof getTotalLength and typeof getBBox on a path element were both undefined"
  !probe{ "for each of the five lab families, write one assertion in a scratch check and record whether jsdom answers it, a ~40-line TypeScript evaluator answers it, or only a browser can; the result fixes ?[path_parser] and each Check tier before commit 3" }
  $%[plan.commit_count, plan.phase_progress]
}
